# Testman, shipped pushback guard (a+b, 2x pushback, 200 meter, no chip): guarding 5a slides p2 24000 instead of 12000.
setup: module meter 5000 0 0 0 5000 0
setup: module pushback_guard 48 2 2000 200 5 1
setup: p1 character testman
setup: p2 character testman
setup: p1 x = -30000
setup: p2 x = 30000
frame 1: p1 5a
frames 5-21: p2 4a+b

frame 5: expect p2 event module
frame 21: expect p2 x > 50000
frames 1-21: expect p1 x = -30000
